  "bug_description": "MainPage.aboutToAppear unconditionally registers iconfont.ttf and DINCOROS-Regular.ttf whenever a MainPage component is created. The business fix guards registration once per process. Repeated same-process MainPage creation via normal UI has not been established: clean source uses router.pushUrl and router.back, not the previously claimed router.replaceUrl flow. Duplicate file parsing, typeface retention, and resulting latency remain unverified without native evidence.",
